caption: Numerical Mastery

Regular — Tier 2: no minimum character-point investment requirement. Unless the Tradition's spell architecture makes that benchmark inapplicable, Mastery requires at least nine legal spells at effective skill 20+. An explicit governing-trait-derived spell-skill ceiling uses the skill-cap exception in Section 5.6. Magery or Power Investiture 3, or the applicable governing trait standard, applies where relevant. Preserve the Tradition's prerequisite-chain, consequential-use, and demonstration requirements.
